@startuml export-old
' The problem: upstream export path, single-threaded, software encode (~6 fps)
' Strict black & white. Render: plantuml -tsvg export-old.puml

title Old Export Path  ·  ~6 fps

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor black

|Renderer main thread|
start
:Decode one frame;
:PixiJS render\n(one frame at a time);
:Draw to 2D canvas;
:getImageData\nGPU → CPU readback;
:ipcRenderer.invoke\n(one IPC round-trip per frame);
|Main process|
:WebCodecs software encoder\nH.264 High · latency = quality;
:JS muxer (mp4-muxer);
:.mp4;
note right
  One CPU core does the render.
  The encoder silently falls back
  to software. Every frame pays a
  full IPC round-trip.
end note
stop

@enduml
